<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήνῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήνυστος, ἀ. πόνος,
				εὐχαί</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				735b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				936c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔργον πράττειν,</span> of
			Penelope's web, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				84a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1285
			</span></i>. Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτ᾽ ἀνηνύτως ἔχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					557.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>endless, never-ending,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					167
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.24.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					507e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοπαθία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.17
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυθός,</span> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.85
			</span></i>, etc.: neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήνυτα μοχθοῦσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					470
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
